{"text":"太和〔十〕九年十一月，使持節、司空公、長樂王丘穆陵亮夫人尉遲，爲亡息牛橛請工鏤石，造此彌勒像一區。願牛橛捨於分段之鄉，騰遊無礙之境。若存託生，生於天上諸佛之所；若生世界，妙樂自在之處；若有苦累，即令解脱。三塗惡道，永絶因趣。一切衆生，咸蒙斯福。","tags":[{"name":"Office","term":"使持節","refId":null,"text":"使持節","start":11,"end":14},{"name":"Office","term":"司空","refId":null,"text":"司空","start":15,"end":17},{"name":"PersonName","term":"尉遲","refId":null,"text":"尉遲","start":28,"end":30},{"name":"PersonName","term":"牛橛","refId":null,"text":"牛橛","start":34,"end":36},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"刻石","refId":null,"text":"鏤石","start":38,"end":40},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":43,"end":45},{"name":"PersonName","term":"牛橛","refId":null,"text":"牛橛","start":50,"end":52},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"分段生死","refId":null,"text":"分段","start":54,"end":56},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"無礙","refId":null,"text":"無礙","start":61,"end":63},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"託生","refId":null,"text":"託生","start":68,"end":70},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"天上","refId":null,"text":"天上","start":73,"end":75},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"妙樂國土","refId":null,"text":"妙樂","start":85,"end":87},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"苦","refId":null,"text":"苦累","start":94,"end":96},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"解脫","refId":null,"text":"解脱","start":99,"end":101},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三途","refId":null,"text":"三塗","start":102,"end":104},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"惡道","refId":null,"text":"惡道","start":104,"end":106},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"衆生","start":114,"end":116}]}